    "description": "Open jailbreak robustness benchmark with 100 harmful behaviors (and 100 matched benign behaviors) aligned to OpenAI usage policies. Attacks submit jailbreak strings; an LLM judge (Llama-3-70B in the paper) labels success. The headline metric is attack success rate (ASR).",
    "summary": "Measures how often jailbreak prompts make the model give harmful answers that break its safety rules.",
